_L8 = [("Segment 1", "Muling nagpaalala ang Department of Health sa publiko na doblehin ang pag-iingat laban sa dengue lalo na ngayong El Nino. Ayon kay Secretary Janet Garin, kahit na mababa ang bilang ng kaso ng dengue ngayong taon kumpara nang nakaraang taon ay posibleng tumaas pa ito sa pagpasok ng tagtuyot.", "Again the Department of Health reminded the public to double their precaution against dengue, especially during this El Nino. According to Secretary Janet Garin, even though the number of dengue cases this year is low compared to last year, it could still rise with the coming of the dry spell."), ("Segment 2", "Paliwanag ng kalihim dahil sa matinding tagtuyot, nag-iimbak ng tubig ang taong-bayan kung saan madalas itong pangitlugan at pagbahayan ng mga lamok. Kaya naman nagpaalala ang ahensiya sa mga mag-iimbak ng tubig na siguruhing laging may takip ang kanilang pinaglalagyan ng tubig at panatilihin ang malinis na kapaligiran para maiwasan ang pagkakaroon ng dengue.", "The secretary explained that because of the severe dry spell, the people store water, where mosquitoes often lay eggs and breed. So the agency reminded those who will store water to make sure that their water container always has a cover and to keep a clean environment to avoid getting dengue.")]
_K8 = [("1. The DOH’s reminder to the public", "To take extra precaution against dengue especially this coming El Nino season."), ("2. Dengue cases this year compared to last year (2 details)", "The dengue case this year is lower compared to last year. However, this will possibly increase because of the coming El Nino."), ("3. The contributing factor that may increase dengue", "The secretary said that during El Nino, people store water which usually becomes a breeding ground for mosquitoes."), ("4. Two suggestions to prevent dengue", "Make sure to cover the containers where water is stored and maintain clean surroundings.")]
_L9 = [("Segment 1", "Mga paghahanda laban sa sakit ngayong tag-ulan. Iwasan ang leptospirosis. Huwag lumangoy, lumusong, at maglaro sa baha. Gumamit ng bota kung talagang kailangan lumusong. At kapag mataas na ang tubig-baha, sumakay sa mga improvised floating devices o rubber boats kung lilikas ng bahay.", "Preparations against diseases this rainy season. Avoid leptospirosis. Do not swim, wade, or play in the flood. Use boots if you really need to wade. And when the floodwater is already high, ride improvised floating devices or rubber boats if you will evacuate the house."), ("Segment 2", "Mga palatandaan o sintomas ng leptospirosis, lagnat, panginginig ng katawan o chills, pananakit ng ulo, binti, kalamnan, at kasu-kasuan, pamumula ng mga mata, paninilaw ng balat, at nahihirapang pag-ihi. Kung patuloy ang lagnat sa loob nang dalawang araw, agad nang kumonsulta sa doktor.", "Signs or symptoms of leptospirosis: fever, chills, pain in the head, legs, muscles and joints, redness of the eyes, yellowing of the skin, and difficulty urinating. If the fever continues for two days, consult a doctor right away.")]
_K9 = [("1. Main idea", "The health advisory is about the things to do against disease (leptospirosis) this rainy season."), ("2. Three things to avoid", "During rainy season, don’t swim; get into; and play into the flood waters."), ("3. Two things to do", "Using boots when getting into the water becomes a necessity. When flood waters rise, ride onto improvised floating devices or rubber boats to evacuate."), ("4. Symptoms (4 details)", "Fever, chills, headache, leg/muscle and joint pains, red eyes, yellow skin (jaundice), labored urination."), ("5. When fever persists", "Immediately consult a doctor.")]
_L10 = [("Host", "So, sir ano po ba ’yung mga factors kung bakit po nagkakaroon ng measles outbreak?", "So, sir, what are the factors why there is a measles outbreak?"), ("Guest", "Well, ang una, is malamig ang panahon. And second is, bago lang tayo nakaranas sa Super Typhoon Yolanda na grabe yung pagkasira ng ating mga environment. At ang ating mga kababayan nasalanta sila. Nawalan sila ng mga tahanan, humina ang kanilang kalusugan. Ang karamihan din sa kanila nagpunta dito sa Metro Manila. So, nagkumpul-kumpol sila sa isang lugar. ’Yung iba naman may mga ubo na galing sa Visayas dito din sa Manila may ubo. So ’yan ay one of the many factors that contributed to the outbreak of measles.", "Well, first, the weather is cold. And second, we just experienced Super Typhoon Yolanda, whose destruction of our environment was severe. And our countrymen were devastated. They lost their homes, their health weakened. Most of them also came here to Metro Manila. So they crowded together in one place. Some of them also have coughs that came from the Visayas, and here in Manila too there is a cough. So that is one of the many factors that contributed to the outbreak of measles."), ("Host", "So ito naman siguro para sa ating mga manonood ngayon, ’yung symptoms ba ng measles, ano ba ’to? Gaano kabilis natin nararamdaman ’to para ma-confirm natin na may measles tayo at meron bang kumbaga mga preventive measures, kumbaga may nararamdaman ako ngayong kaunti, meron bang dapat na medicine na puwede ko nang i-take para kumbaga maiwasan ’to o ano po ba dapat ang ginagawa natin?", "So this is perhaps for our viewers now: what are the symptoms of measles? How quickly do we feel it so that we can confirm we have measles, and are there, so to speak, preventive measures? I feel a little something now; is there a medicine I can already take to prevent it, or what should we do?"), ("Guest", "Wala talagang medicine para maiwasan natin. Ang talagang kuwan diyan e, mass immunization, vaccination no, to prevent the measles no. Now, ang ating prevention diyan is huwag tayong lumapit sa mga pasyente or mga kaibigan natin na umuubo o merong sintoma na nilalagnat sila ’no? Iwasan natin sila. Ang measles ay nakukuha sa hangin. Halimbawa, sila ay umubo, o suminga, uhm, wag tayong lumapit diyan. At sana’y ’tong mga tao natin, itong mga kababayan natin wag umubo na hindi naman tinatakpan ang kanilang bibig at saka huwag mag-sneeze ’no.", "There is really no medicine for us to prevent it. What is really key there is mass immunization, vaccination, to prevent the measles. Now, our prevention there is not to go near patients or friends who are coughing or who have symptoms, who have a fever, okay? Let us avoid them. Measles is caught through the air. For example, if they cough or blow their nose, um, let us not go near. And I hope our people, our countrymen, do not cough without covering their mouths and do not sneeze, okay.")]
_K10 = [("Segment 1 (the book’s gist)", "The speaker or guest talked about the factors that contributed to the measles outbreak. He said that Super Typhoon Yolanda hit the country and destroyed the environment. People were displaced and their health was affected by the displacement. Most of them migrated to Metro Manila. He mentioned people from the Visayas having a cough (or being sick) coming to Manila. (The book’s gist leaves out the typhoon’s name; the script names it.)"), ("Segment 2 (the book’s gist)", "The speaker explained preventive measures against getting measles. He said there is no medicine to prevent measles. The only prevention is immunization or vaccination. He advised not to get closer to patients or friends who are coughing or who have a fever. Measles can be transmitted through the air, so stay away from people who are coughing, blowing their nose or sneezing.")]
